{"id":"npc:%E8%90%A8%E5%B0%94%E8%B4%A1%E6%B8%B8%E5%AE%A2","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"炎国名字叫何昔安，炎国话说的不标准，宗师在萨尔贡游历时教了他一招刀法。在玉门擂台上迅速输给槐琥，抗击天灾时与一众武人一同阻击山海众。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情WB-ST-1_忽梦少年事等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_792_1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_792_1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_792_1$1.png"}],"appearances":[]}